### User & Person Endpoints
### Run Login in auth.http first to get the access token

# ─── Update User ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

PATCH http://{{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "ownerName": "johndoe_updated",
  "password": "newpassword123"
}

### ─── Update User - change status only ──────────────────────────────────────

PATCH http://{{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "active": false
}

### ─── Update Person ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

PATCH http://{{host}}/api/persons/{{personId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "firstName": "Jonathan",
  "email": "jonathan.doe@example.com"
}

### ─── Get Persons - no filters (all) ───────────────────────────────────────

GET http://{{host}}/api/persons
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ─── Get Persons - filter by firstName ────────────────────────────────────

GET http://{{host}}/api/persons?firstName=john
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ─── Get Persons - filter by status ───────────────────────────────────────

GET http://{{host}}/api/persons?status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ─── Get Persons - multiple filters ───────────────────────────────────────

GET http://{{host}}/api/persons?firstName=john&lastName=doe&status=ACTIVE
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
